  "_comment": [
    "Machine-checkable pin for the vendored cardano-foundation/cip113-programmable-tokens CORE tree.",
    "Do not hand-edit any file in this directory: run ./verify-upstream-pin.sh --regenerate instead.",
    "",
    "PREVIOUS PIN: 726d7577515a8762dc182a105109226a5b4acee0 (0.4.0), a commit on the",
    "feat/upgradability-in-place branch that was never on main. It had no pin file at all -- it was",
    "identified after the fact by comparing every validator hash across all 270 upstream commits,",
    "which is the work this file exists to make unnecessary next time.",
    "",
    "THIS PIN moves to upstream main. The delta is documented in docs/CORE-UPGRADE-PLAN.md; the",
    "headline is that programmable_logic_global is dissolved into `transfer` and a new `third_party`,",
    "programmable_logic_base gains a three-constructor dispatch redeemer, and the protocol-params",
    "datum goes from 5 fields to 7 WITH FIELDS 2-4 REORDERED (not appended)."
  ],
