  "vendoring_note": "documentation/ IS vendored, unlike the rwa-token pin which excludes README.md. The core documentation is the specification the Java backend is written against -- withdrawal-index derivation, redeemer shapes, tx composition -- and it drifts from the validators on its own. Pinning it means a doc change shows up as a reviewable diff instead of being invisible.",
